  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When creating a new project I often find myself installing the same 8-12 packages every time. While this process usually only takes a short amount of time, it can be rather tedious to scroll the list and remember every package I need to install.\n\nThis is why I am proposing a way to create and save presets, so that upon project creation creators can select pre-existing presets and automatically install the latest or a pre-defined version of said 'listed' packages. This would not only save creators a couple of minutes, but streamline the process of project creation.",
